WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
One medium bomb is lit beside the waking Ryu.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Ryu guards the standing-medium target sequence.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.100
Kimberly cancels Sprint with the punch stop.

4
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.600
The existing bomb detonates during the throw approach.

5
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.550
The normal throw catches Ryu after the stopped Sprint.

6
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.000
The throw completes beside the wall.
